 blurb="For PMS fund managers: portfolio construction, equity and bond strategies, risk, performance measurement and the SEBI rules you operate under.",
 intro="NISM Series XXI-B is the certification for people who run portfolio management services in India. It goes beyond distribution: how securities are analysed, how portfolios are built, hedged, rebalanced and measured, and how the SEBI Portfolio Managers Regulations shape operations, fees, reporting and ethics.",
 who="Principal officers, fund managers, research analysts, dealers and compliance staff at SEBI-registered portfolio managers, and anyone preparing to manage client portfolios on a discretionary or non-discretionary basis.",
